              highlighted: ["AB","CD","EF"] },
            { text: "I say that the planes are parallel.",
              visible: GIVEN,
              highlighted: ["CD","EF"] },
            { text: "For, if not, then they meet when produced. Let them meet.",
              visible: GIVEN,
